# G8: the mouse on the text screen. Click, double click, triple click, shift-click and drag in the letter, the wheel, then the menu
# bar and a dialog by mouse. Played on the host through quill-app's pointer, and into QUILLDOS.EXE from a QUILL_MOUSE file (AUTOTYPE
# cannot drive a mouse). Places are cells: column, then row, row 1 being the first under the menu bar.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
@click 12 3
@dclick 12 3
@click 30 5
@shiftclick 40 7
@drag 10 9 35 11
@tclick 20 12
@wheel 3
@wheel -1
@click 3 8
@click 3 0
@click 5 3
@click 41 12                  # Open dialog: Cancel
@click 22 0                   # Find menu
@click 24 2                   # Find...
t h i s
@click 11 11                  # Match case
@click 12 13                  # Find Next
@click 27 13                  # Close
